      "writtenOn": "2022-12-01T18:11:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d like to see traces of what\u0027s on the CC line here, if that\u0027s possible.  If you\u0027re seeing the `PE_FLAGS_MSG_DISCARDED` flag, that usually means the partner sent something before we could send our thing.  \n\nThat would make sense if we\u0027re the sink and the partner is in control of collision avoidance, and the partner had an immediate response to our alert.",
      "parentUuid": "c2a40b0c_3bece4f5",
      "revId": "23a2c3afc4c2eea24a12bbf6cc77f6e89e72fd88",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
